From 8ecdcfdf3cf109af9462acb58b8e35aa8e0edd28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:05:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Visual refresh: new logo across the app and restyled
 client viewer

- Angular C logo (the mark is the C of Capture) via a shared civ_logo macro
  and brand-logo.css: app top bar, sign-in, sign-up, registration, employee
  setup and the project access page (header and footer).
- Client viewer restyled without changing its markup, tabs or permissions
  (static/viewer-refresh.css): charcoal top bar continuing across the
  sidebar, white sidebar with blue selection, Plus Jakarta Sans text and
  Geist navigation (both self-hosted, SIL OFL), softer cards. The logo sits
  at the bottom of the sidebar only.
- Ported visually from the captureiv-2 redesign; none of that branch's
  access or feature changes are included.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HbptFaAKPeT417LTNgj5bU
